<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Analytical_Chemistry/Analytical_Chemistry_2.1_(Harvey)/04:_Evaluating_Analytical_Data/4.06:_Statistical_Methods_for_Normal_Distributions" class="mt-section"><span id="Exercise_4.6.4"></span><h5 id="Exercise_4.6.4-127561"><span class="lt-icon-default">Exercise 4.6.4
</span></h5>
